<title>PHILIPPINES: Asiatrust Q3 net 30.721 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Asiatrust Q3 net 30.721 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asiatrust Development Bank said on Wednesday that it posted a 30.721 million peso net income for the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that interest earnings for the period reached 202.420 million pesos, while interest expenses amounted to 131.035 million pesos.</p>
<p>Earnings per share was at 44 centavos.</p>
<p>It did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
